OL,4,CEU-UK talks to the wire              W5
OL,5,                                      W5
OL,6,GNegotiations between the EU and UK   W5
OL,7,Gare "going down to the wire" ahead   W5
OL,8,Gof Friday's summit in Brussels,      W5
OL,9,GDowning Street has said.             W5
OL,10,                                      W5
OL,11,GThe summit is aimed at reaching new  W5
OL,12,Gagreements between the two sides on  W5
OL,13,Gfood trade rules, visas for young    W5
OL,14,Gpeople and carbon emissions pricing. W5
OL,15,                                      W5
OL,16,GThe prime minister's spokesman said  W5
OL,17,Gthat if a deal is secured, the       W5
OL,18,Ggovernment will introduce            W5
OL,19,Glegislation to Parliament next week  W5
OL,20,Gto implement changes.                W5
OL,21,                                      W5
